    {
      "source": "Create a <code>PersistenceUnitContext</code> from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/config/AotRepositoryContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>AotRepositoryContext</code></a> using Jakarta\nPersistence-annotated classes.",
